<p>Levantamos un servidor Nginx dentro de un contenedor en un solo comando.</p>

<h2 id="arrancar-el-contenedor">Arrancar el contenedor</h2>

<div class="language-bash highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code>docker run <span class="nt">-d</span> <span class="nt">--name</span> web <span class="nt">-p</span> 8080:80 nginx
curl <span class="nt">-I</span> http://localhost:8080
</code></pre></div></div>

<h2 id="cómo-funciona">Cómo funciona</h2>

<p><img src="/miblog/assets/images/docker.png" alt="Foto de docker" /></p>]]></content><author><name>Mateo Gutierrez</name></author><category term="contenedores" /><category term="docker" /><category term="nginx" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://mateogc112.github.io/miblog/assets/images/posts/docker/portada-docker.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://mateogc112.github.io/miblog/assets/images/posts/docker/portada-docker.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Apache frente a Nginx</title><link href="https://mateogc112.github.io/miblog/servidores/2026/10/08/apache-frente-a-nginx.html" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Apache frente a Nginx" /><published>2026-10-08T17:30:00+02:00</published><updated>2026-10-08T17:30:00+02:00</updated><id>https://mateogc112.github.io/miblog/servidores/2026/10/08/apache-frente-a-nginx</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://mateogc112.github.io/miblog/servidores/2026/10/08/apache-frente-a-nginx.html"><![CDATA[<p>Comparamos los dos servidores web más usados en Linux.</p>

